1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,600
NARRATOR: Sa isang liblib na sitio sa kabundukan ng Lebak...
(In a remote village in the mountains of Lebak...)

2
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:49,600
ALING ROSA: Daniel! Kaon na anay! Basi maabtan ka sang init!
(Daniel! Come eat first! Before the heat gets to you!)

3
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:54,800
DANIEL: Sige, Nay! Tapuson ko lang ni. Kinahanglan madala ta ang kopra sa banwa buwas.
(Okay, Ma! Let me finish this. We have to bring the copra to town tomorrow.)

4
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:59,700
NARRATOR: Para kay Daniel, bawat ani ay may katumbas na pagod...
(For Daniel, every harvest is paid for in sweat...)

5
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:19,600
MARA: Parang walang nagbago rito. Pareho pa rin ang daan, pati ang mga bahay.
(Nothing seems to have changed. Same road, same houses.)

6
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:23,200
DRIVER: Madamo na ang nagbag-o, Ma'am. Labi na kon gab-i.
(A lot has changed, Ma'am. Especially at night.)

7
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,900
MARA: Bakit? Anong meron sa gabi?
(Why? What happens at night?)

8
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:39,800
ALING ROSA: Tatlong gabi nang may nawawalang alagang hayop.
(For three nights now, animals have gone missing.)

9
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:44,800
LOLA ISING: Hindi lahat ng nasa kagubatan ay dapat hanapin.
(Not everything in the forest should be looked for.)

10
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:49,800
DANIEL: Lola, baka ligaw na aso lang 'yan.
(Lola, it's probably just a stray dog.)

11
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:55,500
LOLA ISING: Sana nga, apo. Sana nga.
(I hope so, child. I hope so.)

12
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:20,600
NARRATOR: Sa Sitio Malinaw, may isang kaugaliang sinusunod ng matatanda.
(In Sitio Malinaw, the elders keep one old rule.)

13
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:25,200
NARRATOR: Kapag dumilim, walang batang pinapayagang lumapit sa kagubatan.
(After dark, no child may go near the forest.)

14
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:29,900
NARRATOR: At kapag may tumawag mula sa dilim, huwag na huwag kang sasagot.
(And if something calls to you from the dark, never answer.)

15
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,800
JUNJUN: Sino 'yan?
(Who's there?)

16
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:44,600
TINIG: Junjun...

17
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:49,600
TINIG: Junjun... tulungan mo ako.
(Junjun... help me.)

18
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,800
JUNJUN: Sino ka?
(Who are you?)
